OL,3,GNEWSA'Life-changing' NHS apprenticeship
OL,4,Ascheme expands
OL,5,
OL,6,FA successful NHS apprenticeship scheme
OL,7,Fthat began on the Isle of Wight is now
OL,8,Fbeing rolled out across the South.
OL,10,FThe Careers for Young People Programme,
OL,11,Fset up in partnership with the island's
OL,12,FHTP Apprenticeship College, gives
OL,13,Fpeople aged 16 to 24 the chance to
OL,14,Ftrain and work within the NHS.
OL,16,FOther health trusts nationwide are now
OL,17,Finterested in replicating the scheme.
OL,19,FApprentices taking part in the
OL,20,Fprogramme said it had changed their
OL,21,Flives and given them confidence and a
OL,22,Fsense of purpose.
